Compile if VERSION is at least 3 and VERSION plus 1 is equal to 5:
    Say "both".
End compile if.
Compile if VERSION is greater than 10 or MISSING is not defined:
    Say "or branch".
End compile if.
Compile if FLAG is defined and VERSION times 2 is greater than 5:
    Say "unreachable".
Elif (VERSION shifted left by 1) is equal to 8 and __STDC_VERSION__ is at least 202311:
    Say "elif expression".
Otherwise:
    Say "none".
End compile if.
Compile if not (VERSION is equal to 4):
    Say "not four".
Otherwise:
    Say "four".
End compile if.
